---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@/components/container.astro";
---

<Layout title="Videos">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Videos</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-8">
        Note: Most videos listed here are available on Amazon Prime for a small
        fee or included with a subscription. Some may also be available for free
        elsewhere online.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-baseline mb-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-2 sm:mb-0">
              Bad Faith
            </h2>
            <a
              href="https://www.amazon.com/Bad-Faith-Stephen-Ujlaki/dp/B0CWP2KRTW/ref=sr_1_1?crid=292M7E8RZGWH3&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.1B36OF2aFgRSmzu0C1GvR4zY9VSjERlr49bETcM9oqymShJ8BX-4hP-SMN7HC7L84suPW1oQ6n_xBcb-QT3owHCQl-_blc3fbu26uiTrlE3f_Jlj1ezspFw443cX5bBPM7pETfRqJ1da_wrR7hs82wxFrT5lpnQYOaDhgCz6PSqZPxnbcUIARyFeJW64R-1VXgPGRPSyFe6mqjHr42AIIC2tsSwc-44Jv6t7LMglf7Y.F23xyOsAAi3_POkwt3x4dbFtIjPFFRH6NDyKEsKloCo&dib_tag=se&keywords=bad+faith&qid=1744393862&sprefix=bad+faith%2Caps%2C117&sr=8-1"
              target="_blank"
              class="inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:text-primary-dark font-medium text-sm sm:text-base flex-shrink-0">
              Watch on Amazon Prime
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4 ml-1"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700">
            The current day assault on democracy did not begin with Trumpism. It
            did not begin with the Tea Party. It did not begin with the Moral
            Majority. It did not even begin in this century. The current day
            assault on democracy began with the White Supremacy Movement in the
            1960's as part of a shrewd, calculated, and well executed plan that
            became cloaked as a religious movement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-baseline mb-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-2 sm:mb-0">
              God & Country
            </h2>
            <a
              href="https://www.amazon.com/God-Country-Dan-Partland/dp/B0CVNH2413"
              target="_blank"
              class="inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:text-primary-dark font-medium text-sm sm:text-base flex-shrink-0">
              Watch on Amazon Prime
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4 ml-1"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700">
            GOD & COUNTRY looks at the implications of Christian Nationalism and
            how it distorts not only our constitutional republic, but
            Christianity itself. Featuring prominent Christian thought leaders,
            GOD & COUNTRY asks this question: What happens when a faith built on
            love, sacrifice, and forgiveness grows political tentacles,
            conflating power, money, and belief into hyper-nationalism?
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  .bg-primary-dark {
    background-color: #1a5c36; /* A slightly darker shade of your primary color */
  }
</style>
